      "content": "Recovery Only displays this instruction unconditionally, but backup capabilities and the Backup screen are explicitly optional (and absent in the current composition). That configuration now tells users to download and verify a backup without providing any way to do so. Select this guidance only when Backup is actually reachable, retaining an accurate fallback for releases without it.",
